  "$comment": "Routing policy keyed by agent-profile id (roster/profiles.json, or Paseo's daemon.agentProfiles when Paseo is the launcher). The profiles own the runtime binding (provider/model/modeId/thinkingOptionId); this file owns who may write, who may review, and which family they belong to. Every id here must exist in the profiles or src/lib/roster.mjs throws.",
